  "slug": "spinach-bean-breakfast-skillet",
  "name": "Spinach and black bean breakfast skillet",
  "description": "A soy-free skillet breakfast for two: mushrooms browned in dry pans with black beans and cooked lentils, a whole bag of spinach folded in at the end, finished with sunflower seeds and cilantro.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Set two wide non-stick pans over high heat, divide the mushrooms between them in a single layer and leave them undisturbed for 3 minutes.",
    "Stir once, add the salt, and cook for 3 minutes more until the pans are dry again.",
    "Divide the black beans and the lentils between the pans and warm them through for 2 minutes without crushing them.",
    "Fold in the spinach a large handful at a time and cook for 2 minutes, just until it collapses.",
    "Divide between two plates, then scatter the sunflower seeds and the cilantro over the top."
